better_spawners.guide.index.intro=Upgradeable spawners for Bedrock. Pick a section:
better_spawners.guide.general=General
better_spawners.guide.general.body=§aObtain§r\nMine a vanilla mob spawner with §eSilk Touch§r to get a Better Spawner. Type is kept if the spawner has spawned at least one mob this session; otherwise set it later with a spawn egg.\n\n§aMove§r\nMine a Better Spawner with §eSilk Touch§r to keep its type and upgrades. Without Silk Touch, pickaxe breaks drop XP only.\n\n§aChange type§r\nRight-click a Better Spawner with a §eSpawn Egg§r to set the mob type (egg is consumed).
better_spawners.guide.modifiers=Modifiers
better_spawners.guide.modifiers.intro=Right-click a Better Spawner with the item to apply. §eSneak§r + right-click reverses the change.
